<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="bg-navybrand-900 text-white py-12 border-b border-navybrand-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-3">
        <span class="text-skybrand-300 font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Pertanyaan Yang Sering Diajukan</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">Temukan jawaban cepat seputar tata cara sewa, persyaratan identitas, jaminan, hingga jam operasional store.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <button class="faq-header w-full p-6 text-left font-bold text-navybrand-800 text-base flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-50">
                <span>1. Apa saja dokumen jaminan yang dibutuhkan untuk menyewa kamera?</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-skybrand-500 transition-transform faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="p-6 pt-0 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 hidden">
                Penyewa wajib menjaminkan 2 identitas fisik asli yang valid. Pilihan identitas bisa berupa KTP, SIM A/C, KTM (Kartu Tanda Mahasiswa), NPWP, STNK, atau Paspor. Salah satu jaminan wajib berupa KTP/KTM asli.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <button class="faq-header w-full p-6 text-left font-bold text-navybrand-800 text-base flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-50">
                <span>2. Berapa pilihan durasi sewa yang tersedia?</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-skybrand-500 transition-transform faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="p-6 pt-0 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 hidden">
                Kami menyediakan 3 pilihan paket durasi fleksibel: <strong>6 Jam</strong> (Paket Cepat/Event Singkat), <strong>12 Jam</strong> (Half-Day), dan <strong>24 Jam</strong> (Full Day). Durasi sewa dihitung sejak waktu pengambilan barang dari store.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <button class="faq-header w-full p-6 text-left font-bold text-navybrand-800 text-base flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-50">
                <span>3. Apakah bisa pesan/booking unit untuk tanggal mendatang?</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-skybrand-500 transition-transform faq-icon"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="p-6 pt-0 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 hidden">
                Sangat bisa! Kamu bisa melakukan reservasi jauh-jauh hari agar alat impianmu tidak kedahuluan disewa orang lain. Cukup hubungi Admin via WhatsApp dan bayar DP booking Rp 50.000 saja.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
